  "summary": "Mattermost doesn't validate that a username returned during bot registration belongs to a bot account",
  "details": "Mattermost versions 11.6.x \u003c= 11.6.1, 11.5.x \u003c= 11.5.4, 10.11.x \u003c= 10.11.15, 10.11.x \u003c= 10.11.16 fail to validate that a username returned during bot registration belongs to a bot account, which allows an unprivileged attacker to intercept private messages sent by plugins via direct message channels by pre-registering a user account with a predictable plugin bot username. Mattermost Advisory ID: MMSA-2026-00649",
